From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:21:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 211/342] NeoCam: a camera application for stills, clips,
 schedules and motion

Stills and video clips at any frame size the camera has; captures on a
schedule (a still or a clip every so many seconds, minutes or hours)
and when something moves (simple motion detection with a sensitivity);
saved in a folder and uploaded by FTP (its own client) or SFTP (the
sftp command, the password through SSH_ASKPASS). In the Deskbar's
Applications.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
